==Greek==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|el|grc|μήτηρ||mother}}, from {{inh|el|grk-pro}}, from {{inh|el|ine-pro|*méh₂tēr}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[miˈte̞ra]|lang=el}}

===Noun===
{{el-noun|f|μητέρες|m=πατέρας}}

# [[mother]]
# something that is the greatest of its kind

